# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Trivy Vulnerability Suppression Configuration (.trivyignore)
# A2A Hub (Agent2Agent Hub)
#
# Technical Governance & Justification:
# The following CVEs target unreleased upstream patch branches, theoretical
# reflection/polymorphic deserialization attack vectors, or legacy subcomponents
# that are not reachable/executable within A2A Hub's stateless REST & WebSocket architecture.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

